Clustering:
```
def components(recs):  # recs: list of dicts with actor, rows(set), harness(set-or-empty)
    n=len(recs); parent=list(range(n))
    def find/union...
    for i<j:
        if a.actor and b.actor and a.actor==b.actor: union
        elif a.rows and b.rows and jaccard>=0.9: union
        elif a.harness and b.harness and a.harness==b.harness: union
    return ncomponents
```
Note: harness equality should be exact set equality of script-hash sets; only when both non-empty.

ESS_lower = components over bound records.
ESS_upper = number of distinct actors among bound records (a generous upper bound).
Strict core: records with distinct actor AND pairwise Jaccard<0.5 AND (harness empty or distinct).

